  [38;5;153mcheckout.js:11[39m.

  [1mFix:[0m one change, at the origin of the bad value — [38;5;153mgetDiscountRate[39m falls back to [38;5;153m0[39m when the code isn't in the table. I
  fixed it there rather than in [38;5;153mfinalPrice[39m or at the [38;5;153mtoFixed[39m call because [38;5;153mgetDiscountRate[39m is also exported on its own;
  patching downstream would have left it still handing [38;5;153mundefined[39m to any other caller.

  Two things worth noting:

